    "body": "Add a protected main-branch Pages deployment overlay for a legacy processor that repeatedly stalls in `deployment_queued`.\n\nVerified failure:\n- multiple distinct main SHAs built valid Pages artifacts\n- stale predecessor deployments were cancelled successfully\n- the legacy generated deploy still remained `deployment_queued` for its full fixed 600-second timeout\n- `actions/deploy-pages@v5` source confirms `MAX_TIMEOUT = 600000`, so a larger `timeout` input is silently capped\n- the official Pages settings API switch to `build_type=workflow` was attempted with a least-permission Actions token and correctly rejected with HTTP 403 `Resource not accessible by integration`; no repository setting changed\n- existing `github-pages` environment protection remains intact\n\nWorkflow behavior:\n- triggers on protected `main` changes to `docs/**` or this workflow, with optional manual exact-SHA dispatch\n- verifies the exact checked-out source and optional marker\n- uploads only the exact `docs` artifact using the official upload action\n- obtains the standard Actions OIDC token\n- derives an isolated 40-hex recovery deployment version from source SHA, workflow run ID, and attempt\n- gives a simultaneous legacy deploy a short creation window, cancels only its current main-SHA deployment, then creates the isolated version through the same official Pages REST payload used by `actions/deploy-pages@v5`\n- retries creation if a stale in-progress deployment is explicitly identified\n- polls the recovery deployment for up to 1800 seconds and handles all terminal Pages states\n- serializes recovery runs without cancelling an active one\n\nPermissions:\n- Actions read, contents read, Pages write, and OIDC token write only\n- no administration permission and no environment-protection modification\n\nScope:\n- exactly one workflow file\n- no runtime, docs, CSS, game data, state, memory, conflict, economy, settlement, or application-source changes\n- accepted Stage 7.13 implementation remains `69a1137c6ab4ede2a0d1e420cde477f29b0b2949`\n- current Stage 7.13 artifact marker remains `stage7_13_aftermath_dm_followup_20260806c`.",
